 pve-manager (9.2.41) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * ui: SAN:
     - also detect disabled storages of external storage plugins when opening
       the LUN wipe confirmation, so the confirmation still asks to verify
       that no storage plugin uses the LUN.
     - when adding a multipath entry, also check a WWID that was typed before
       the node's LUN list finished loading, so that Enter no longer adds only
       a part of a listed WWID. A part of a WWID that the list does not offer,
       for example of an NVMe namespace, no longer counts as invalid.
